title: 'M1.12 slice 3 round 2 reading: replay folds inside verify''s pass; turn binds to the client inject'
summary: 'Chose to fold inside verify''s single pass (VerifyLogOptions.onRow) over a seq/hash cross-check: one read, one SQLite snapshot, so a row committed mid-verify is never folded. turn.sent binds to the last unconsumed origin:client inject. A string bytes field is the divergence inject-plaintext. The CLI states trust root home-local and the keystore state.'
symbols_touched:
