body: 'B1 / Aegis C2: the earlier version read the files twice (verify, then fold), a TOCTOU window. Aegis C1: string bytes are no longer re-hashed and accepted; they are a divergence, because the append path refuses them. The supervisor and local-session fix is T-019 in the M1.8 lane. Aegis medium: replay keys come from the home itself, so it proves consistency, never provenance; the readout says so.'
